description_en:
Jump Force is an epic 3D action-adventure fighting game. Besides having a perfect control system, the graphics are also the best in terms of Android games. The game honors and elevates Akira Toriyama's work by adapting it to mobile devices, and it's an official product.

The game features over 10 anime and dozens of different characters mixed into one game!

You'll be able to play with characters from Naruto, Dragon Ball, One Piece, etc.

This game is an incredible modification of Dissidia 012, a 3D fighting game for PSP, and today you'll find this game completely modified with various different characters from famous anime and cartoons.

Play the complete 3D graphics story and Final Fantasy series in story mode. New permanent menus in the style of DBZ, Naruto, My Hero Academia, Knights of the Zodiac, and new battle menus and character selection. All characters also perform attacks and have BT4 models. This means that all character models look like BT4 and also attack. Most top performers think you'll see a complete BT3 (Battleground) style map.

Check out one of the best fighting mods for your Android phone, with various characters, game modes, and the incredible gameplay of PlayStation 2!

